.SH 標準規格
.TP 
\fBmkstemp\fP()
POSIX.1\-2001.
.TP 
\fBmkstemps\fP()
.\" mkstemps() appears to be at least on the BSDs, Mac OS X, Solaris,
.\" and Tru64.
BSD.
.TP 
\fBmkostemp\fP()
.TQ
